OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 26 NOV
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Max Roach
OL,5,     GKate Molleson is joined by Kevin
OL,6,     GLeGendre to explore the life and
OL,7,     Gwork of drummer and composer Max
OL,8,     GRoach. Today focusing on Max
OL,9,     GRoach as a political force.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham introduces live
OL,12,     Gmusic from pianist Alice Sara
OL,13,     GOtt. Plus, Andras Keller leads
OL,14,     GConcerto Budapest in their most
OL,15,     Grecent tour.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
