OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 26 NOV
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,6,     GOrchestra and conductor Martyn
OL,7,     GBrabbins perform the ultimate
OL,8,     Gromantic symphony, plus Sir James
OL,9,     GMacMillan's searing The
OL,10,     GConfession of Isobel Gowdie.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Watching from the Wings
OL,12,     GMichael Goldfarb remembers his
OL,13,     Gtheatrical life as an actor. In
OL,14,     Gthis essay, he's performing with
OL,15,     Gthe Cocteau Repertory Theatre in
OL,16,     GNew York.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
